      "id": "claim_75a855fb2a2b4bed8ed7b70e1c22c56e",
      "statement": "The domain entity model is: a Wallet holds zero or more Positions, each inside one Pool; a Pool contains many Bins and marks exactly one as the active bin at the current market price; a Position spans a contiguous bin range and is either in range or out of range.",
